Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(post): retract and name mill setup changes

Handle SetupChange before M0/M1 in seven mill dialects.
Pin dialect retracts, section resets, and named clearance refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

